      "writtenOn": "2020-04-03T22:37:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is called when the lid angle \u003e180 degree, which disables the keyboard.\n\nThe jacuzzi case is that the CONFIG_LID_ANGLE_UPDATE is not defined, that EC won\u0027t keep track of the lid angle so won\u0027t call this callback.  I don\u0027t know why the CONFIG is disabled.\n\nThe Minnie case is too old that this logic was still in common/lid_angle.c and not separated out to a board-specific function.",
